  "description": "DIMSEZ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C108 H88 Dy6 N8 O23. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy9 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy10 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy11 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy12 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 16 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.645-3.864 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.59-111.51°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(L)7(HL)(MeOH)2(H2O)(OH)2(OAc)]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
